      "typical_award_size": "Mountain View is one of nine entitlement jurisdictions in the county. CDBG capital funds (minimum 65 percent of the allocation) and HOME funds are allocated directly to pipeline affordable housing projects as loans repaid as program income, because capital NOFA rounds drew few applicants; examples include Paulson Park I and Monte Vista Terrace rehabilitation (CDBG, July 2025), Ginzton Terrace and The Fountains, and $1.86 million HOME plus $0.78 million HOME-ARP to Lot 12 (October 2025). Public services run on a two-year NOFA with $171,000 a year of General Fund added under Council Policy A-8. Exact FY 2026-27 entitlement amounts were not in the documents opened.",
